<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa sees 7.68 mln real inflow July 1-10.</title>
<headline>Bovespa sees 7.68 mln real inflow July 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net foreign capital inflows into the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) were 7.68 million reais from July 1 to 10, the bolsa said.</p>
<p>Foreign buys totalled 1.55 billion reais, against foreign sales of 1.54 billion reais, it said.</p>
<p>So far this year, net foreign investment in the Sao Paulo bourse has totalled 1.46 billion reais, it added.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
